(3194478, 448946, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. Um, I am not sure what I think of this image! I think I am ending up liking it because it does a technically great (I love the lighting, colors, and composition) job of presenting an uncomfortable subject (with subjects like these I find that a poor technical job helps it seem like it was just done for the shock factor).</td>', 'Oh wow. Um, I am not sure what I think of this image! I think I am ending up liking it because it does a technically great (I love the lighting, colors, and composition) job of presenting an uncomfortable subject (with subjects like these I find that a poor technical job helps it seem like it was just done for the shock factor).', '2007-01-08 01:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3194479, 449154, 49315, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done</td>', 'Very nicely done', '2007-01-08 01:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
