(3194497, 447472, 69387, '<td valign="top">Cleanly processed, but the photo is too busy. I wish this was a bit bigger.</td>', 'Cleanly processed, but the photo is too busy. I wish this was a bit bigger.', '2007-01-08 02:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3194499, 449101, 53316, '<td valign="top">The technicals are pretty off.  The head is chopped off, the background is blown out, and the focus could be better.  However... all of that actually adds up, for me, to a good image. I just really like it.  It is not the everyday portrait and I am liking that uniqueness.</td>', 'The technicals are pretty off.  The head is chopped off, the background is blown out, and the focus could be better.  However... all of that actually adds up, for me, to a good image. I just really like it.  It is not the everyday portrait and I am liking that uniqueness.', '2007-01-08 02:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3194555, 448956, 66201, '<td valign="top">Oh you are very funny! Hmmm...yes this is something I''m supposed to be following up on too!</td>', 'Oh you are very funny! Hmmm...yes this is something I''m supposed to be following up on too!', '2007-01-08 02:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3194559, 448880, 66201, '<td valign="top">This is such a simple idea, and yet very effective. I am still deciding on whether or not I like the table surface in the shot. I may (an undecided "may") have swivelled the book to put it on a diagonal and then cropped in tighter so the the very edges of the book only popped into view in a few places. But as I say I''m still thinking about it.</td>', 'This is such a simple idea, and yet very effective. I am still deciding on whether or not I like the table surface in the shot. I may (an undecided "may") have swivelled the book to put it on a diagonal and then cropped in tighter so the the very edges of the book only popped into view in a few places. But as I say I''m still thinking about it.', '2007-01-08 02:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3194563, 449344, 56672, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection you got on the riflings.  (Unrelated: Never liked Glocks that much, though.)</td>', 'I like the reflection you got on the riflings.  (Unrelated: Never liked Glocks that much, though.)', '2007-01-08 02:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3194570, 449185, 56672, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  The contrast seems a bit high.  Pretty blown out on my LCD - the piggy bank loses distinction.</td>', 'Interesting.  The contrast seems a bit high.  Pretty blown out on my LCD - the piggy bank loses distinction.', '2007-01-08 02:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3194582, 448820, 56672, '<td valign="top">Very amusing</td>', 'Very amusing', '2007-01-08 02:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
