(3194713, 449291, 49109, '<td valign="top">Funny one. Good crop and color. A tad too much softening for my taste, eyes are too dark.</td>', 'Funny one. Good crop and color. A tad too much softening for my taste, eyes are too dark.', '2007-01-08 04:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
