(3194729, 449251, 57229, '<td valign="top">The hands themselves make this shot special. Maybe turned up the contrast in them? The sweater adds nothing useful and the negative space...well, negative space is negative space and it''s right enough to have it there, I suppose. I''m thinking that some sort of textured and generally recognisable thing like - brick wall, grass, sky...<br/>Excuse me for thinking out loud, but the hands are as good as that praying icon thing (nearly).<br/>Anyway, 6 for what you have.</td>', 'The hands themselves make this shot special. Maybe turned up the contrast in them? The sweater adds nothing useful and the negative space...well, negative space is negative space and it''s right enough to have it there, I suppose. I''m thinking that some sort of textured and generally recognisable thing like - brick wall, grass, sky...Excuse me for thinking out loud, but the hands are as good as that praying icon thing (nearly).Anyway, 6 for what you have.', '2007-01-08 04:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
