(3196638, 449291, 65779, '<td valign="top">Don''t get this.  Sorry.</td>', 'Don''t get this.  Sorry.', '2007-01-08 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196650, 448654, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a great and high-spirited photo!</td>', 'What a great and high-spirited photo!', '2007-01-08 15:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196666, 446856, 65779, '<td valign="top">Don''t get this.  Sorry. We don''t have snow.</td>', 'Don''t get this.  Sorry. We don''t have snow.', '2007-01-08 15:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196677, 447480, 65779, '<td valign="top">Nice Free Study, but not for this one.</td>', 'Nice Free Study, but not for this one.', '2007-01-08 15:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196686, 449245, 34113, '<td valign="top">You must be a microbiologist. Great photo.</td>', 'You must be a microbiologist. Great photo.', '2007-01-08 15:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196687, 448820, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s one bizarre looking foot, even acknowledging you have a man''s leg in there. Looks like a clubfoot or something.</td>', 'That''s one bizarre looking foot, even acknowledging you have a man''s leg in there. Looks like a clubfoot or something.', '2007-01-08 15:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196689, 449207, 65779, '<td valign="top">Looks over-sharpened to me</td>', 'Looks over-sharpened to me', '2007-01-08 15:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196690, 447835, 34113, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautifully done.', '2007-01-08 15:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196691, 448946, 68388, '<td valign="top">lol.  Smart.</td>', 'lol.  Smart.', '2007-01-08 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196693, 445800, 34113, '<td valign="top">Most of us wonder how long you can put this one off. Nice.</td>', 'Most of us wonder how long you can put this one off. Nice.', '2007-01-08 15:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196694, 446856, 34113, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like you actually did it.</td>', 'Wow, looks like you actually did it.', '2007-01-08 15:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196698, 448077, 34113, '<td valign="top">My sentiments too.</td>', 'My sentiments too.', '2007-01-08 15:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196700, 448851, 34113, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2007-01-08 15:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196703, 448054, 12200, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful, serene shot...one that feels like it should have a story and has genuine emotional content. I think a little light dodging on the white of the boat to bring out some contrast might be nice...and I would personally blur the background or apply a gradient filter to highly the foreground, but this is still very well executed as is.</td>', 'This is a beautiful, serene shot...one that feels like it should have a story and has genuine emotional content. I think a little light dodging on the white of the boat to bring out some contrast might be nice...and I would personally blur the background or apply a gradient filter to highly the foreground, but this is still very well executed as is.', '2007-01-08 15:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196704, 449151, 34113, '<td valign="top">Nice effort and creative.</td>', 'Nice effort and creative.', '2007-01-08 15:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196706, 446350, 34113, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2007-01-08 15:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196710, 448771, 12200, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....the liberal use of blur on the house is unconvincing to me...and it feels "fake" when the beach that is obviously in nearly the same proximity is SOOOO much sharper. It has a nice effect on the water and the horizon, though.</td>', 'Hmmm....the liberal use of blur on the house is unconvincing to me...and it feels "fake" when the beach that is obviously in nearly the same proximity is SOOOO much sharper. It has a nice effect on the water and the horizon, though.', '2007-01-08 15:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196711, 449291, 30861, '<td valign="top">Awwwww.... Buck up, dahlin''!</td>', 'Awwwww.... Buck up, dahlin''!', '2007-01-08 15:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196712, 446593, 34113, '<td valign="top">Shame on you. I''d be happy to help. Nice photo.</td>', 'Shame on you. I''d be happy to help. Nice photo.', '2007-01-08 15:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196714, 448054, 34113, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2007-01-08 15:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196715, 449185, 12200, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice idea and generally well executed, but I think this photo suffers from overall lack of contrast--particularly in the hand.</td>', 'It''s a very nice idea and generally well executed, but I think this photo suffers from overall lack of contrast--particularly in the hand.', '2007-01-08 15:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196718, 448187, 34113, '<td valign="top">You''re piling on my shared guilt now.</td>', 'You''re piling on my shared guilt now.', '2007-01-08 15:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196720, 449242, 34113, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2007-01-08 15:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196721, 449289, 12200, '<td valign="top">Too much "noise" in this shot...speckles are distracting to me. But I LOVE the perspective and grandeur of the architecture as you''ve captured it.</td>', 'Too much "noise" in this shot...speckles are distracting to me. But I LOVE the perspective and grandeur of the architecture as you''ve captured it.', '2007-01-08 15:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196728, 446213, 12200, '<td valign="top">This is rather clever, and it definitely elicited a chuckle from me. But it''s not a very interesting photo, compositionally speaking.</td>', 'This is rather clever, and it definitely elicited a chuckle from me. But it''s not a very interesting photo, compositionally speaking.', '2007-01-08 15:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196729, 448590, 65779, '<td valign="top">After "Sticky" I am all OD''d on Post-It notes.</td>', 'After "Sticky" I am all OD''d on Post-It notes.', '2007-01-08 15:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196732, 448935, 34113, '<td valign="top">That would be too hard. Nice shot.</td>', 'That would be too hard. Nice shot.', '2007-01-08 15:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196737, 449228, 12200, '<td valign="top">The sunspots are very distracting, even though the perspective is very lovely. It reminds me of something I would see in a college brochure.</td>', 'The sunspots are very distracting, even though the perspective is very lovely. It reminds me of something I would see in a college brochure.', '2007-01-08 16:00:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3196739, 448880, 34113, '<td valign="top">Well done and nice photo.</td>', 'Well done and nice photo.', '2007-01-08 16:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196742, 448333, 12200, '<td valign="top">The focus is weak here. Both objects are blurry to me, and my eyes don''t quite know what to make of this composition.</td>', 'The focus is weak here. Both objects are blurry to me, and my eyes don''t quite know what to make of this composition.', '2007-01-08 16:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196744, 449289, 34113, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t agree more.</td>', 'Couldn''t agree more.', '2007-01-08 16:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196751, 447780, 12200, '<td valign="top">I attempted a shot very much like this and ultimately abandoned this approach. But I like your perspective here.</td>', 'I attempted a shot very much like this and ultimately abandoned this approach. But I like your perspective here.', '2007-01-08 16:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196754, 448619, 34113, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition. Don''t fix it though, it might not end up so nice as this. Well done.</td>', 'Great colors and composition. Don''t fix it though, it might not end up so nice as this. Well done.', '2007-01-08 16:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196756, 447480, 12200, '<td valign="top">I am so jealous of photographers that have regular access to scenery like this! Nice work with this composition.</td>', 'I am so jealous of photographers that have regular access to scenery like this! Nice work with this composition.', '2007-01-08 16:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196758, 448880, 12200, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, but this composition is ill-focused.</td>', 'I like the perspective, but this composition is ill-focused.', '2007-01-08 16:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196760, 446272, 34113, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative.</td>', 'Interesting and creative.', '2007-01-08 16:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196762, 447450, 12200, '<td valign="top">Wow...this one should place for sure.</td>', 'Wow...this one should place for sure.', '2007-01-08 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196766, 447126, 12200, '<td valign="top">Ummm...what is it? I see a completely black field with a teensy HINT of a tree outline and some small, enigmatic bright thing near the bottom. Weirdest sunset I''ve ever seen, assuming it actually is one. If the title is ironic...I''d love to hear what you were going for, compositionally, with this shot.</td>', 'Ummm...what is it? I see a completely black field with a teensy HINT of a tree outline and some small, enigmatic bright thing near the bottom. Weirdest sunset I''ve ever seen, assuming it actually is one. If the title is ironic...I''d love to hear what you were going for, compositionally, with this shot.', '2007-01-08 16:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196778, 447332, 12200, '<td valign="top">I did one very similar to this. I like the perspective, but the focus feels a little too soft to convince me. The way I rectified this (we''ll see how the voters feel about it) is by using the macro feature to zoom in on one particular verse or passage. You might try that and see how it works for you.</td>', 'I did one very similar to this. I like the perspective, but the focus feels a little too soft to convince me. The way I rectified this (we''ll see how the voters feel about it) is by using the macro feature to zoom in on one particular verse or passage. You might try that and see how it works for you.', '2007-01-08 16:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196785, 449207, 12200, '<td valign="top">Very clever.</td>', 'Very clever.', '2007-01-08 16:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196788, 448656, 12200, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot...but I think it suffers from the typical "indoor color effect" which is nice in theory but rarely works out well in practice--at least in my limited experience. If I were you, I might try this one in black-and-white or another two-tone combination, and then tweak for enhanced contrast.</td>', 'I like it a lot...but I think it suffers from the typical "indoor color effect" which is nice in theory but rarely works out well in practice--at least in my limited experience. If I were you, I might try this one in black-and-white or another two-tone combination, and then tweak for enhanced contrast.', '2007-01-08 16:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196852, 449344, 70664, '<td valign="top">nice glock</td>', 'nice glock', '2007-01-08 16:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196962, 446095, 56672, '<td valign="top">Knowing someone (electronically) who had to do this recently, I can understand the procrastination.  It took her a year after she''d decided.<br/> <br/>She made it a new year''s resolution, and finally had the talk last week.</td>', 'Knowing someone (electronically) who had to do this recently, I can understand the procrastination.  It took her a year after she''d decided. She made it a new year''s resolution, and finally had the talk last week.', '2007-01-08 16:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196983, 447164, 68956, '<td valign="top">Good picture, maybe a little less foreground.</td>', 'Good picture, maybe a little less foreground.', '2007-01-08 17:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196991, 448851, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but think it would have worked much better with a cigarette instead of a match.</td>', 'I like the shot but think it would have worked much better with a cigarette instead of a match.', '2007-01-08 17:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196994, 449228, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very, very beautiful.</td>', 'Very, very beautiful.', '2007-01-08 17:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3196999, 448915, 56672, '<td valign="top">I think the angle on this is a little too flat.</td>', 'I think the angle on this is a little too flat.', '2007-01-08 17:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197005, 449261, 68956, '<td valign="top">Looks like the text has been added?</td>', 'Looks like the text has been added?', '2007-01-08 17:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197010, 446205, 68956, '<td valign="top">I can see the noise and grain might be adding to the atmosphere, but it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I can see the noise and grain might be adding to the atmosphere, but it doesn''t work for me.', '2007-01-08 17:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197013, 449201, 68956, '<td valign="top">A little bit underexposed on the bull.</td>', 'A little bit underexposed on the bull.', '2007-01-08 17:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197016, 448946, 68956, '<td valign="top">A bit disturbing.</td>', 'A bit disturbing.', '2007-01-08 17:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197018, 447126, 56672, '<td valign="top">The lack of any details really breaks this concept for me.</td>', 'The lack of any details really breaks this concept for me.', '2007-01-08 17:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197020, 445834, 68956, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this small, dark picture.</td>', 'I don''t understand this small, dark picture.', '2007-01-08 17:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197028, 449294, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great image to go with the title. Very subtle, and that is matched well by the presentation of the image.</td>', 'Great image to go with the title. Very subtle, and that is matched well by the presentation of the image.', '2007-01-08 17:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197034, 448981, 12200, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful composition. Did you apply selective desaturation to achieve this effect, or is this "au natural"?</td>', 'This is a very beautiful composition. Did you apply selective desaturation to achieve this effect, or is this "au natural"?', '2007-01-08 17:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197048, 447472, 12200, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors, but I am struggling to find the focus of this shot. It feels too much like a collage, and as such it''s not as striking or original to me as something with a more clearly defined subject.</td>', 'I really like the colors, but I am struggling to find the focus of this shot. It feels too much like a collage, and as such it''s not as striking or original to me as something with a more clearly defined subject.', '2007-01-08 17:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197056, 447676, 12200, '<td valign="top">Wow...this is such a creative vantage you''ve got going for you here. If you could have gotten the camera just a little lower, you could have lost the hint of the streetlights in the lower right by the church. It gives this building a sense (even if just an illusion?) of being in the middle of nowhere--a bit of architectural grandeur in the middle of an otherwise unimproved wasteland. Very nice. You might consider, too, lightly dodging the shadows on the front side of the church. I mean, the contrast is nice as is, but there''s some nice things to be seen there and might come out a little more if the shadows weren''t quite so overwhelming. Overall, I rate this one an 8.</td>', 'Wow...this is such a creative vantage you''ve got going for you here. If you could have gotten the camera just a little lower, you could have lost the hint of the streetlights in the lower right by the church. It gives this building a sense (even if just an illusion?) of being in the middle of nowhere--a bit of architectural grandeur in the middle of an otherwise unimproved wasteland. Very nice. You might consider, too, lightly dodging the shadows on the front side of the church. I mean, the contrast is nice as is, but there''s some nice things to be seen there and might come out a little more if the shadows weren''t quite so overwhelming. Overall, I rate this one an 8.', '2007-01-08 17:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197073, 449154, 12200, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. You could use this to creatively propose, of course. ;-) From a photographic standpoint...the composition is attrative, but the focus is not sharp enough to be persuasive.</td>', 'Nice idea. You could use this to creatively propose, of course. ;-) From a photographic standpoint...the composition is attrative, but the focus is not sharp enough to be persuasive.', '2007-01-08 17:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197097, 449310, 12200, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes this appear overexposed. Something warmer would have been more convincing. Some selective saturation (esp. oranges and greens tones). I recognize and understand that you WANTED these flowers'' wilt to come out. But with so little color against that stark black backdrop, it feels like just a faulty exposure. A little creative use of a sharpening brush tool around the flowers and leaves might have helped, too.</td>', 'The lighting makes this appear overexposed. Something warmer would have been more convincing. Some selective saturation (esp. oranges and greens tones). I recognize and understand that you WANTED these flowers'' wilt to come out. But with so little color against that stark black backdrop, it feels like just a faulty exposure. A little creative use of a sharpening brush tool around the flowers and leaves might have helped, too.', '2007-01-08 17:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197105, 448481, 12200, '<td valign="top">I was going to do a shot like this, but then I realized that I had no tall grass to shoot because everything around here is dead from drought. I like the overall composition, but the colors are not as vivid as I think they could be. You might consider doing a selective desaturation on every tone but the reds to make that lawmower pop out against the rest of the composition.</td>', 'I was going to do a shot like this, but then I realized that I had no tall grass to shoot because everything around here is dead from drought. I like the overall composition, but the colors are not as vivid as I think they could be. You might consider doing a selective desaturation on every tone but the reds to make that lawmower pop out against the rest of the composition.', '2007-01-08 17:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197113, 446205, 12200, '<td valign="top">The lighting of this image is very unattractive to me. It feels as though it''s a low-res scanned Poloroid that was cropped too wide(hence the white strip on the right of the image). I think some darkening and contrast, maybe some noise removal, could have really salvaged this image.</td>', 'The lighting of this image is very unattractive to me. It feels as though it''s a low-res scanned Poloroid that was cropped too wide(hence the white strip on the right of the image). I think some darkening and contrast, maybe some noise removal, could have really salvaged this image.', '2007-01-08 17:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197119, 449331, 12200, '<td valign="top">I love the title. I also like the composition and the colors, but something about it feels "empty" to me. Perhaps the zoom is just a little too much, or maybe it was cropped just a little to tightly for my taste. My overall impression places this as a 5.</td>', 'I love the title. I also like the composition and the colors, but something about it feels "empty" to me. Perhaps the zoom is just a little too much, or maybe it was cropped just a little to tightly for my taste. My overall impression places this as a 5.', '2007-01-08 17:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197126, 447187, 12200, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of the fisheye effect (whether it was a lens or a filter I don''t know). My only complaint is that the subject feels unfocused and a little blurry. I might try using a healing brush to sharpen the features of the face. It''s a shame this one was submitted for the Centered Composition II challenge!</td>', 'Very effective use of the fisheye effect (whether it was a lens or a filter I don''t know). My only complaint is that the subject feels unfocused and a little blurry. I might try using a healing brush to sharpen the features of the face. It''s a shame this one was submitted for the Centered Composition II challenge!', '2007-01-08 17:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197139, 449195, 12200, '<td valign="top">Composition is lovely. Not sure how I feel about the profile pose, but I don''t think it necessarily detracts from the overall image effect. Next time, you might consider having your model sling that guitar over her shoulder and walk away toward the barn in the distance along the railroad. One minor editing complaint: the dodging around the subject''s face and torso is giving her a sort of "glow" that may have been intentional, but if it was it''s not convincing enough for me. Overall: a solid 7 from me.</td>', 'Composition is lovely. Not sure how I feel about the profile pose, but I don''t think it necessarily detracts from the overall image effect. Next time, you might consider having your model sling that guitar over her shoulder and walk away toward the barn in the distance along the railroad. One minor editing complaint: the dodging around the subject''s face and torso is giving her a sort of "glow" that may have been intentional, but if it was it''s not convincing enough for me. Overall: a solid 7 from me.', '2007-01-08 17:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197147, 449178, 12200, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking. I was going to attempt a very similar shot of an old truck like this in some overgrown weeds, but I don''t think it would have come out nearly this striking. I will be sorely disappointed if this one doesn''t ribbon. 10 from me.</td>', 'Breathtaking. I was going to attempt a very similar shot of an old truck like this in some overgrown weeds, but I don''t think it would have come out nearly this striking. I will be sorely disappointed if this one doesn''t ribbon. 10 from me.', '2007-01-08 17:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197153, 449129, 12200, '<td valign="top">I think this one might have been more striking with tighter vertical crops at the left and right to draw focus more squarely on the very warmly illuminated shop. I might also have used a perspective crop to "straigten" the vantage (which appears a little crooked to the right). Overall, a 6 from me.</td>', 'I think this one might have been more striking with tighter vertical crops at the left and right to draw focus more squarely on the very warmly illuminated shop. I might also have used a perspective crop to "straigten" the vantage (which appears a little crooked to the right). Overall, a 6 from me.', '2007-01-08 17:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197160, 449261, 12200, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. I''m not entirely persuaded because of the "busy-ness" of the foreground, though. Would you consider making everything but the "past due" black and white?</td>', 'Interesting perspective. I''m not entirely persuaded because of the "busy-ness" of the foreground, though. Would you consider making everything but the "past due" black and white?', '2007-01-08 17:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197241, 449146, 53316, '<td valign="top">Would this be putting off "defrosting the freezer"?  I think that''s what it is and it''s a creative concept, just is maybe a bit difficult to understand at first.</td>', 'Would this be putting off "defrosting the freezer"?  I think that''s what it is and it''s a creative concept, just is maybe a bit difficult to understand at first.', '2007-01-08 18:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197244, 447126, 53316, '<td valign="top">So I saw a tiny bit of detail and I wanted to see what it was.. Playing around with it a bit gave me a better idea of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=449700" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">what''s there</a>.  I like it, and if I understand the concept you are going for, I like that as well.</td>', 'So I saw a tiny bit of detail and I wanted to see what it was.. Playing around with it a bit gave me a better idea of what''s there.  I like it, and if I understand the concept you are going for, I like that as well.', '2007-01-08 18:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197255, 447857, 15711, '<td valign="top">Something about this is very pleasing to me. It''s earnest and fresh.  I might like to see you play a bit with levels, curves, etc.  But that''s just my taste.  I think the focus on the face could be a bit more sharp. I''m sensing a slight bit of blur and it should be all about the face.  I''m wondering if in the placement, you focused on the back of the chair. 6</td>', 'Something about this is very pleasing to me. It''s earnest and fresh.  I might like to see you play a bit with levels, curves, etc.  But that''s just my taste.  I think the focus on the face could be a bit more sharp. I''m sensing a slight bit of blur and it should be all about the face.  I''m wondering if in the placement, you focused on the back of the chair. 6', '2007-01-08 18:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197257, 447976, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a classic.  Love the aqua of the water with the touch of red in his shorts.</td>', 'This is a classic.  Love the aqua of the water with the touch of red in his shorts.', '2007-01-08 18:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197259, 448054, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice nostalgic feel to this.  Not sure if I''m crazy about the centering of the subject.  I love it when there is more neg. space to one side.</td>', 'Nice nostalgic feel to this.  Not sure if I''m crazy about the centering of the subject.  I love it when there is more neg. space to one side.', '2007-01-08 18:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197262, 449251, 15711, '<td valign="top">A sentiment we can all relate to. I like the DOF.</td>', 'A sentiment we can all relate to. I like the DOF.', '2007-01-08 18:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197267, 449136, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pleasing and I like the severe turquoise tones. 7</td>', 'Pleasing and I like the severe turquoise tones. 7', '2007-01-08 18:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197269, 448981, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really pretty. I like the gray of the concrete and that POP of beautiful color from the leaf.  Interesting perspective. 7</td>', 'Really pretty. I like the gray of the concrete and that POP of beautiful color from the leaf.  Interesting perspective. 7', '2007-01-08 18:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3197275, 449195, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like an album cover. I like the focus and the fact that you encorporated the silo in the background. Nashville, here she comes!!</td>', 'Looks like an album cover. I like the focus and the fact that you encorporated the silo in the background. Nashville, here she comes!!', '2007-01-08 18:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
