(3198516, 449101, 43115, '<td valign="top">I wanted to leave you a comment on this photo...<br/> <br/>This photo <b>speaks to me</b>.<br/> <br/>One has to read the title, and the challenge discription, and think about it for a second... and then it hits you.<br/> <br/>This is not top notch photography, technically speaking.  I''m not going to go into the technical problems with this photo, because I''m sure other commenters will.  But for me, the tehnical rawness of the capture adds to the feeling of shyness, of subversion required to get the photo, of dispair of the photographer for never being able to talk to this girl.<br/> <br/>A 10 from me, though I doubt you''ll get out of the bottom quarter of the challenge, because so many voters here don''t look past the glitz and flash and moderate oversaturation.  Keep taking photos that mean something.</td>', 'I wanted to leave you a comment on this photo... This photo speaks to me. One has to read the title, and the challenge discription, and think about it for a second... and then it hits you. This is not top notch photography, technically speaking.  I''m not going to go into the technical problems with this photo, because I''m sure other commenters will.  But for me, the tehnical rawness of the capture adds to the feeling of shyness, of subversion required to get the photo, of dispair of the photographer for never being able to talk to this girl. A 10 from me, though I doubt you''ll get out of the bottom quarter of the challenge, because so many voters here don''t look past the glitz and flash and moderate oversaturation.  Keep taking photos that mean something.', '2007-01-09 00:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
