(3200388, 447004, 50641, '<td valign="top">Great picture - good tonal balance and shadows.  And I like the subject :)<br/> <br/>Frittered<br/> <br/>Those bananas on the table,<br/>they wanted to be muffins,<br/>they wanted to be bread,<br/>for it''d sure beat bein'' nuthin''<br/>but fodder for the fruitflies,<br/>slime oozing from their coats,<br/>as whiffs of noisome ester<br/>swim from limp banana boats.<br/>But summer wouldn''t grant it,<br/>they toasted where they sat. <br/>Brown Banana Betty blanched<br/>as banana splits went splat.<br/>The cornflakes never saw them.<br/>The yogurt stayed pristine.<br/>The peanutbutter sandwich <br/>bore no pale yellow gleam.<br/>So now their hides have blackened,<br/>their innards overripe.<br/>Their good I''ve sadly wasted.<br/>Damn I''m glad it''s garbage night.</td>', 'Great picture - good tonal balance and shadows.  And I like the subject :) Frittered Those bananas on the table,they wanted to be muffins,they wanted to be bread,for it''d sure beat bein'' nuthin''but fodder for the fruitflies,slime oozing from their coats,as whiffs of noisome esterswim from limp banana boats.But summer wouldn''t grant it,they toasted where they sat. Brown Banana Betty blanchedas banana splits went splat.The cornflakes never saw them.The yogurt stayed pristine.The peanutbutter sandwich bore no pale yellow gleam.So now their hides have blackened,their innards overripe.Their good I''ve sadly wasted.Damn I''m glad it''s garbage night.', '2007-01-09 12:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
