(3200542, 446838, 5112, '<td valign="top">Since this is advanced editing, the dustbunnies could have been edited out.  Also, it is probably a better fit for centred than this challenge, although the centred composition doesn''t really work all that well here.  I like the colours, particularily in the sky.  ~3</td>', 'Since this is advanced editing, the dustbunnies could have been edited out.  Also, it is probably a better fit for centred than this challenge, although the centred composition doesn''t really work all that well here.  I like the colours, particularily in the sky.  ~3', '2007-01-09 13:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3200545, 449185, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very good entry for the challenge (one of my favorites).  The movement in the bill, and the grabbing look of the hand really sell this image.  ~10</td>', 'Very good entry for the challenge (one of my favorites).  The movement in the bill, and the grabbing look of the hand really sell this image.  ~10', '2007-01-09 13:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
