(3200571, 447045, 5112, '<td valign="top">Not a whole lot to redeem this image.  I think that basicallyl the composition isn''t all that bad, but it is just way too dark, out of focus, and without much of a message or charm.  I hope you can get that lens you want.  ~2</td>', 'Not a whole lot to redeem this image.  I think that basicallyl the composition isn''t all that bad, but it is just way too dark, out of focus, and without much of a message or charm.  I hope you can get that lens you want.  ~2', '2007-01-09 13:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
