(3200575, 446205, 5112, '<td valign="top">To my eyes, there isn''t a whole lot to redeem this image.  The scene is not particularily attractive, the composition is centred and without much charm, the colours are very muted, and there''s a lot of noise.  ~2</td>', 'To my eyes, there isn''t a whole lot to redeem this image.  The scene is not particularily attractive, the composition is centred and without much charm, the colours are very muted, and there''s a lot of noise.  ~2', '2007-01-09 13:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
