(3204434, 447857, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun image. My only note might be lightening of the hair a touch, just to show the movement in it.</td>', 'Fun image. My only note might be lightening of the hair a touch, just to show the movement in it.', '2007-01-10 06:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204439, 449233, 6999, '<td valign="top">Can''t help thinking that the maze of angles and lines you had available here might have made fro an interesting composition: this seems like a standard viewpoint, snapshot.</td>', 'Can''t help thinking that the maze of angles and lines you had available here might have made fro an interesting composition: this seems like a standard viewpoint, snapshot.', '2007-01-10 06:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204442, 448907, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well lit still life; I wonder if you mightn''t have made more of the composition though: the lines of this are quite flat and straightforward.</td>', 'Well lit still life; I wonder if you mightn''t have made more of the composition though: the lines of this are quite flat and straightforward.', '2007-01-10 06:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204444, 449253, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ha! 5 or 10 ... tempting fate?</td>', 'Ha! 5 or 10 ... tempting fate?', '2007-01-10 06:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204450, 448694, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. A touch more care with the extremes of the image - the intruding branches in the sky really, the cropping, might have made for a cleaner feeling image overall. Love the lines and the details.</td>', 'Interesting composition. A touch more care with the extremes of the image - the intruding branches in the sky really, the cropping, might have made for a cleaner feeling image overall. Love the lines and the details.', '2007-01-10 06:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204453, 446272, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love the light fading gently into the hair. Could get all complicated about the challenge, but it''s far too nice for that.</td>', 'Love the light fading gently into the hair. Could get all complicated about the challenge, but it''s far too nice for that.', '2007-01-10 06:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204459, 446856, 6999, '<td valign="top">The lines all take the eye to the top of that hill, and then the definition of the image seems to collapse. I know it''s the cloud, but it upsets the eye somewhat, leaves it wondering where to go - mind you, that''s so often the problem when you get to the top, I suppose. Anyhow, there''s always another mountain ...</td>', 'The lines all take the eye to the top of that hill, and then the definition of the image seems to collapse. I know it''s the cloud, but it upsets the eye somewhat, leaves it wondering where to go - mind you, that''s so often the problem when you get to the top, I suppose. Anyhow, there''s always another mountain ...', '2007-01-10 06:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204461, 447080, 6999, '<td valign="top">Colour temperature seems off slightly: slightly blue in places - is that a combination of artificial and natural light? The draping of the tape is messy, and I''m no fan of taking bright colours into key lines like that.</td>', 'Colour temperature seems off slightly: slightly blue in places - is that a combination of artificial and natural light? The draping of the tape is messy, and I''m no fan of taking bright colours into key lines like that.', '2007-01-10 06:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204465, 448626, 6999, '<td valign="top">It''s the fringe hints that make this: the legs obviously, the mountain of cups.</td>', 'It''s the fringe hints that make this: the legs obviously, the mountain of cups.', '2007-01-10 06:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204467, 447323, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong composition, perhaps needs more in the way of lighting and compositional thought to make real impact.</td>', 'Strong composition, perhaps needs more in the way of lighting and compositional thought to make real impact.', '2007-01-10 06:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204470, 448956, 6999, '<td valign="top">Far too far away from a physiotherapist to be trying that kind of stuff. Light the surreality, but not a great fan of the jokiness, if that makes sense.</td>', 'Far too far away from a physiotherapist to be trying that kind of stuff. Light the surreality, but not a great fan of the jokiness, if that makes sense.', '2007-01-10 06:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204475, 449134, 6999, '<td valign="top">The entire thing seems over-exposed - probably OK simply for the wood, but that takes no account of the sky and the rest.</td>', 'The entire thing seems over-exposed - probably OK simply for the wood, but that takes no account of the sky and the rest.', '2007-01-10 06:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204476, 446205, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite dreadful - so over lightened with no depth of blacks whatsoever. Add in the white bar image right and this just seems like a joke.</td>', 'Quite dreadful - so over lightened with no depth of blacks whatsoever. Add in the white bar image right and this just seems like a joke.', '2007-01-10 06:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204486, 448343, 6999, '<td valign="top">Pretty straightforward seeming set-up - I''m not sure about the closeness of everything to the edges of frame - feels like you''ve crowded your composition too much.</td>', 'Pretty straightforward seeming set-up - I''m not sure about the closeness of everything to the edges of frame - feels like you''ve crowded your composition too much.', '2007-01-10 06:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204498, 449289, 6999, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel straight - don''t know whether that''s the case, but it discomforts the eye too much - and I think that detracts from the patterns and light that seems to be your true subject here.</td>', 'Doesn''t feel straight - don''t know whether that''s the case, but it discomforts the eye too much - and I think that detracts from the patterns and light that seems to be your true subject here.', '2007-01-10 06:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204501, 449338, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost posterized feeling colours, most un-photographic seeming to me.</td>', 'Almost posterized feeling colours, most un-photographic seeming to me.', '2007-01-10 06:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204505, 449178, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very straightforward image - the obvious standing-up point of view, framing simply to include the edges of the truck, colour just accurate. This then, depends for its impact only on the subject, rather than the photographers relation to it, and that won''t be enough to engage people''s attention.</td>', 'Very straightforward image - the obvious standing-up point of view, framing simply to include the edges of the truck, colour just accurate. This then, depends for its impact only on the subject, rather than the photographers relation to it, and that won''t be enough to engage people''s attention.', '2007-01-10 06:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204510, 448187, 6999, '<td valign="top">Amidst that chaos, I think we need to have some formal movement to draw the eye through this image: some repetition, some specific colours, some leading lines, some distribution through the frame.</td>', 'Amidst that chaos, I think we need to have some formal movement to draw the eye through this image: some repetition, some specific colours, some leading lines, some distribution through the frame.', '2007-01-10 06:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204516, 447676, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good postcard image; I wonder if some will consider this shoe-horned in to the challenge, but I think it''s well enough done to prevent that happening. i''m no huge fan of this really, but after some truly awful photographs, it''s interesting to see something simply well photographed.</td>', 'Good postcard image; I wonder if some will consider this shoe-horned in to the challenge, but I think it''s well enough done to prevent that happening. i''m no huge fan of this really, but after some truly awful photographs, it''s interesting to see something simply well photographed.', '2007-01-10 06:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204530, 447142, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice simple image, thought-out composition, effective light. Can you tell it doesn''t excite me much? After the raft of truly dreadful stuff in this challenge though, it''s great to see just a well crafted image.</td>', 'Nice simple image, thought-out composition, effective light. Can you tell it doesn''t excite me much? After the raft of truly dreadful stuff in this challenge though, it''s great to see just a well crafted image.', '2007-01-10 06:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204535, 447450, 6999, '<td valign="top">I/R? The most interesting I/R image I''ve seen, if it is. I dislike the twee-ness of it, the sentimentality, but i do like the shapes and details of the ferns and leaves.</td>', 'I/R? The most interesting I/R image I''ve seen, if it is. I dislike the twee-ness of it, the sentimentality, but i do like the shapes and details of the ferns and leaves.', '2007-01-10 06:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204540, 445800, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''d say this needs some processing, or simply some moment of light that is more interesting than this very flat moment: there''s no shape to those columns, no strong sense of organisation to the bare branches, and the gravestones are almost completely lost.</td>', 'I''d say this needs some processing, or simply some moment of light that is more interesting than this very flat moment: there''s no shape to those columns, no strong sense of organisation to the bare branches, and the gravestones are almost completely lost.', '2007-01-10 07:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204674, 447126, 27605, '<td valign="top">This seems too minimalist to me, maybe just a matter of personal preference.  I can barely discern the silhouette of the tree.</td>', 'This seems too minimalist to me, maybe just a matter of personal preference.  I can barely discern the silhouette of the tree.', '2007-01-10 07:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204678, 446856, 27605, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot but I don''t see the connection to the challenge; understanding the title would probably help! :0]</td>', 'Lovely shot but I don''t see the connection to the challenge; understanding the title would probably help! :0]', '2007-01-10 07:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204683, 447355, 27605, '<td valign="top">Mmmm... good representation of a favorite expression; nice work there!</td>', 'Mmmm... good representation of a favorite expression; nice work there!', '2007-01-10 07:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204694, 448771, 58330, '<td valign="top">Don''t put it off a moment longer. I did it 4 years ago, way before time, and have never looked back. Impecunious and happy is better than wealthy and never knowing your family. Nice mood and timless picture.7</td>', 'Don''t put it off a moment longer. I did it 4 years ago, way before time, and have never looked back. Impecunious and happy is better than wealthy and never knowing your family. Nice mood and timless picture.7', '2007-01-10 08:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204697, 446694, 58330, '<td valign="top">Start anew, its easier! Nice mood but a bit blown out at the top left. 6</td>', 'Start anew, its easier! Nice mood but a bit blown out at the top left. 6', '2007-01-10 08:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204700, 448912, 58330, '<td valign="top">You''re a lot healthier for it, I bet! 6</td>', 'You''re a lot healthier for it, I bet! 6', '2007-01-10 08:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204713, 449212, 58330, '<td valign="top">A pity there is no detail on the birds, probably because your light meter was influenced by the large area of bright sky. I find it helps to set it manually on a slightly longer exposure than the auto version says.5</td>', 'A pity there is no detail on the birds, probably because your light meter was influenced by the large area of bright sky. I find it helps to set it manually on a slightly longer exposure than the auto version says.5', '2007-01-10 08:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204720, 448956, 58330, '<td valign="top">It looks too agonising. Keep the procrastination going as long as you can! Nice view. 6</td>', 'It looks too agonising. Keep the procrastination going as long as you can! Nice view. 6', '2007-01-10 08:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204737, 447676, 58330, '<td valign="top">Do I recognise this place from a challenge a while ago? Interesting lighting and nice building. 6, but I''ll bump it up to 10 if you go to church now.</td>', 'Do I recognise this place from a challenge a while ago? Interesting lighting and nice building. 6, but I''ll bump it up to 10 if you go to church now.', '2007-01-10 08:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204748, 448793, 58330, '<td valign="top">Nice colour tones. 7</td>', 'Nice colour tones. 7', '2007-01-10 08:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204751, 448735, 58330, '<td valign="top">The worst job in the world! Great picture showing that you obviously feel the same. 7</td>', 'The worst job in the world! Great picture showing that you obviously feel the same. 7', '2007-01-10 08:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204755, 449294, 58330, '<td valign="top">When you do, come and help me!</td>', 'When you do, come and help me!', '2007-01-10 08:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204758, 448907, 58330, '<td valign="top">No wonder they look so new. Nice image. 7</td>', 'No wonder they look so new. Nice image. 7', '2007-01-10 08:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204762, 449101, 58330, '<td valign="top">Get on with! The other person is probably more nervous than you.6</td>', 'Get on with! The other person is probably more nervous than you.6', '2007-01-10 08:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204770, 446213, 58330, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humour. 6</td>', 'Good sense of humour. 6', '2007-01-10 08:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204774, 449245, 58330, '<td valign="top">Good texture. 6</td>', 'Good texture. 6', '2007-01-10 08:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204791, 449134, 58330, '<td valign="top">This isn''t procrastination, its neglect! Nice mix of colours. 6</td>', 'This isn''t procrastination, its neglect! Nice mix of colours. 6', '2007-01-10 08:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204936, 449151, 58330, '<td valign="top">Good effect from the different colours. Boys or girls? 7</td>', 'Good effect from the different colours. Boys or girls? 7', '2007-01-10 08:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3204980, 449195, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  The B&amp;W works very well here. 7</td>', 'Very nice shot.  The B&W works very well here. 7', '2007-01-10 08:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205009, 448308, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the processing and  color in this shot. The focus could be a tad sharper on the house though. 6 because of the sharpness.</td>', 'I love the processing and  color in this shot. The focus could be a tad sharper on the house though. 6 because of the sharpness.', '2007-01-10 08:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205015, 449178, 58330, '<td valign="top">Good combination of colours and toning. 7</td>', 'Good combination of colours and toning. 7', '2007-01-10 08:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205029, 447142, 58330, '<td valign="top">I think I prefer it with slightly less foreground, but other than that it is a very tranquil setting and you should get there soon!6</td>', 'I think I prefer it with slightly less foreground, but other than that it is a very tranquil setting and you should get there soon!6', '2007-01-10 09:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205036, 448935, 21816, '<td valign="top">Such a great expression you have there! I like the old style feel to the shot. Nice work!</td>', 'Such a great expression you have there! I like the old style feel to the shot. Nice work!', '2007-01-10 09:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205052, 449344, 58330, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.7</td>', 'Interesting composition.7', '2007-01-10 09:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205499, 447962, 65083, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2007-01-10 10:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205503, 448735, 65083, '<td valign="top">when you finish come to my house I have a basket that looks like that :)</td>', 'when you finish come to my house I have a basket that looks like that :)', '2007-01-10 10:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205510, 449178, 65083, '<td valign="top">I might know where you can get another just like this :)</td>', 'I might know where you can get another just like this :)', '2007-01-10 10:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205658, 449254, 57661, '<td valign="top">Cool! :)</td>', 'Cool! :)', '2007-01-10 10:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205805, 447126, 4747, '<td valign="top">Too Funny, I wonder how many will <i>not</i> get it...</td>', 'Too Funny, I wonder how many will not get it...', '2007-01-10 11:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205813, 448481, 70139, '<td valign="top">Good title. Boring and snapshotty.</td>', 'Good title. Boring and snapshotty.', '2007-01-10 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206064, 447126, 68059, '<td valign="top">Am I missing something here? :)</td>', 'Am I missing something here? :)', '2007-01-10 12:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206074, 449291, 68059, '<td valign="top">Love it - great humor and, yes, photography!  A 9</td>', 'Love it - great humor and, yes, photography!  A 9', '2007-01-10 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206080, 448422, 68059, '<td valign="top">Þú ert aðalhetjan hérna - gef þér 10 fyrir það.</td>', 'Þú ert aðalhetjan hérna - gef þér 10 fyrir það.', '2007-01-10 12:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206241, 449195, 61155, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and DOF, but there is some distracting haloing around the model. Looks good in mono.</td>', 'Nice clarity and DOF, but there is some distracting haloing around the model. Looks good in mono.', '2007-01-10 12:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206497, 449161, 29486, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this has to do with Challenge Topic. Looks like you just wanted to try and validate a nice picture.</td>', 'Not sure what this has to do with Challenge Topic. Looks like you just wanted to try and validate a nice picture.', '2007-01-10 13:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206506, 448912, 29486, '<td valign="top">Me too! Thank goodness not that many. Nice job.</td>', 'Me too! Thank goodness not that many. Nice job.', '2007-01-10 13:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206510, 449093, 29486, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what UFO is.</td>', 'I don''t understand what UFO is.', '2007-01-10 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206519, 448735, 29486, '<td valign="top">Love it, great shot.</td>', 'Love it, great shot.', '2007-01-10 13:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206532, 448654, 29486, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I like the motion.</td>', 'Good shot. I like the motion.', '2007-01-10 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206539, 449130, 29486, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2007-01-10 13:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206550, 448952, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too generic for topic. Seems like you just wanted a picture rather than actually showing something specific that you put off.</td>', 'Too generic for topic. Seems like you just wanted a picture rather than actually showing something specific that you put off.', '2007-01-10 13:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206559, 448133, 29486, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. They never get to see you because you''re busy?  The slight tilt on the banister is a little disturbing.</td>', 'I don''t get it. They never get to see you because you''re busy?  The slight tilt on the banister is a little disturbing.', '2007-01-10 13:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206574, 449344, 29486, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what that is. Whatever it is isn''t attractive to me nor is the all the white space and composition.</td>', 'I have no idea what that is. Whatever it is isn''t attractive to me nor is the all the white space and composition.', '2007-01-10 13:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206578, 447135, 29486, '<td valign="top">All to familar sight. Nice job on showing something real!</td>', 'All to familar sight. Nice job on showing something real!', '2007-01-10 13:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206583, 446213, 29486, '<td valign="top">I was looking for something more real rather than a contrived photo used just for a score.</td>', 'I was looking for something more real rather than a contrived photo used just for a score.', '2007-01-10 13:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206591, 448308, 29486, '<td valign="top">Cool. Kept it real. I like that.</td>', 'Cool. Kept it real. I like that.', '2007-01-10 13:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206608, 448978, 29486, '<td valign="top">I like the real topic. The photo could have been somewhat better though. It''s just a bit too blown out on the top and then comes down the right side. Maybe if there was a lot more clothes then it would have been more dramatic.</td>', 'I like the real topic. The photo could have been somewhat better though. It''s just a bit too blown out on the top and then comes down the right side. Maybe if there was a lot more clothes then it would have been more dramatic.', '2007-01-10 13:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206616, 449311, 29486, '<td valign="top">I was looking for something more specific that you put off. This seems to be generic for the sake of a nicer photo.</td>', 'I was looking for something more specific that you put off. This seems to be generic for the sake of a nicer photo.', '2007-01-10 13:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206627, 447927, 29486, '<td valign="top">I don''t want a tribute, I want to see what you put off doing. DNMC.</td>', 'I don''t want a tribute, I want to see what you put off doing. DNMC.', '2007-01-10 13:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206629, 449134, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice real topic, I like it. The tone is too harsh though. You overprocessed it.</td>', 'Nice real topic, I like it. The tone is too harsh though. You overprocessed it.', '2007-01-10 13:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206724, 446205, 61138, '<td valign="top">My garage looks like this!</td>', 'My garage looks like this!', '2007-01-10 14:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206943, 447126, 61138, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2007-01-10 14:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206966, 448054, 66241, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2007-01-10 14:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207067, 447164, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think your white balance has drifted a touch too far to the blue; more unfortunately for the image is, I think, the composition: too many extraneous elements crowd the upper part of frame, and then the lower part is absolutely simple. You might, for instance, have made the same point with a shot solely of the snow on the vehicle - there must be some interesting forms and lines made by that snow covering, and we''d only need to see the snow on the vehicle to know that the garage wasn''t finished, no?</td>', 'I think your white balance has drifted a touch too far to the blue; more unfortunately for the image is, I think, the composition: too many extraneous elements crowd the upper part of frame, and then the lower part is absolutely simple. You might, for instance, have made the same point with a shot solely of the snow on the vehicle - there must be some interesting forms and lines made by that snow covering, and we''d only need to see the snow on the vehicle to know that the garage wasn''t finished, no?', '2007-01-10 15:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207090, 448565, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition - almost a pity about the plane, given the strangeness of a bloke pulling a vacuum cleaner across the tarmac. Nice treatment too, though perhaps in the end the difficulty, composition-wise, of the placement of the plane does for the final effect.</td>', 'Interesting composition - almost a pity about the plane, given the strangeness of a bloke pulling a vacuum cleaner across the tarmac. Nice treatment too, though perhaps in the end the difficulty, composition-wise, of the placement of the plane does for the final effect.', '2007-01-10 15:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207096, 448612, 6999, '<td valign="top">Vignetting feels a bit forced; strong composition though; won''t be surprised if you get some challenge-relevance comments.</td>', 'Vignetting feels a bit forced; strong composition though; won''t be surprised if you get some challenge-relevance comments.', '2007-01-10 15:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207104, 448978, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not, I''m afraid, an interesting composition: I think there might have been more effective ways to portray this photographically, rather than a very straightforward image of the pile of clothes, centred, and over-exposed.</td>', 'Not, I''m afraid, an interesting composition: I think there might have been more effective ways to portray this photographically, rather than a very straightforward image of the pile of clothes, centred, and over-exposed.', '2007-01-10 15:05:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3207144, 449130, 6999, '<td valign="top">This kind of reflective surface always seems to cry out for a good soft light in a set-up composition. I think the backwards/forward foot position doesn''t complement the very square-on angle of the scales, and makes for an uncomfortable dynamic in the image. Nice that you''ve shown just enough of the ankles to make clear a certain, shall we say, carrying of weight?</td>', 'This kind of reflective surface always seems to cry out for a good soft light in a set-up composition. I think the backwards/forward foot position doesn''t complement the very square-on angle of the scales, and makes for an uncomfortable dynamic in the image. Nice that you''ve shown just enough of the ankles to make clear a certain, shall we say, carrying of weight?', '2007-01-10 15:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207168, 449339, 6999, '<td valign="top">With their sign, just to resolve the doubts of the viewers. I get a sense of a strange pushiness to the shadows in this shot - not necessarily a bad thing, as it would enhance the decrepitude of the scene, but it feels kind of unneccesary here - the boarding-up tells the same story anyhow.</td>', 'With their sign, just to resolve the doubts of the viewers. I get a sense of a strange pushiness to the shadows in this shot - not necessarily a bad thing, as it would enhance the decrepitude of the scene, but it feels kind of unneccesary here - the boarding-up tells the same story anyhow.', '2007-01-10 15:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207180, 449242, 6999, '<td valign="top">Cries out for the black point to be sorted out: it seems quite a high value of grey is a far as it gets; that makes the entire thing look washed out, lacking contrast.</td>', 'Cries out for the black point to be sorted out: it seems quite a high value of grey is a far as it gets; that makes the entire thing look washed out, lacking contrast.', '2007-01-10 15:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207195, 447126, 6999, '<td valign="top">How strange. I actually quite like that use of very low level black on black, but in the end it feels like a weak joke.</td>', 'How strange. I actually quite like that use of very low level black on black, but in the end it feels like a weak joke.', '2007-01-10 15:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207334, 449286, 48890, '<td valign="top">A pretty shot.  I wish the light worked a little bit better here. 8</td>', 'A pretty shot.  I wish the light worked a little bit better here. 8', '2007-01-10 15:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207359, 448054, 48890, '<td valign="top">A very nice landscape.  I wish the sky had a bit of texture.</td>', 'A very nice landscape.  I wish the sky had a bit of texture.', '2007-01-10 15:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207396, 448907, 48890, '<td valign="top">Love the texture and the colour of the rope; you obviously worked with light in this picture.  But this shot does nothing else for me: the idea is too up-front, the composition is non-existent, the removed background subtracts a lot, and the weird format does not help the matters. 4</td>', 'Love the texture and the colour of the rope; you obviously worked with light in this picture.  But this shot does nothing else for me: the idea is too up-front, the composition is non-existent, the removed background subtracts a lot, and the weird format does not help the matters. 4', '2007-01-10 15:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207424, 447004, 48890, '<td valign="top">What a great subject to photograph for a still life: the colour and the texture of their skin is very interesting to look at.   However, this is a very half-handed attempt: there is no interesting composition, no interesting background, the light is too even.  Was this a product shot?.. 4</td>', 'What a great subject to photograph for a still life: the colour and the texture of their skin is very interesting to look at.   However, this is a very half-handed attempt: there is no interesting composition, no interesting background, the light is too even.  Was this a product shot?.. 4', '2007-01-10 15:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207450, 448612, 48890, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject.  The diagonal is too carefully framed, so that the shot gets this unnatural, preconceived taste.  The vignette is too obviously added in PP. 5</td>', 'An interesting subject.  The diagonal is too carefully framed, so that the shot gets this unnatural, preconceived taste.  The vignette is too obviously added in PP. 5', '2007-01-10 15:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207485, 447187, 48890, '<td valign="top">A great composition for using a fish eye.  One of my pet peeves with most usage of the fish eye is that it is usually just being used for the effect.  Well, in this shot it, actually, works.  The car on the left nicely breaks the symmetry.  I really don''t like what you did with dodging and burning here - the shot looks unnatural because of that. 6</td>', 'A great composition for using a fish eye.  One of my pet peeves with most usage of the fish eye is that it is usually just being used for the effect.  Well, in this shot it, actually, works.  The car on the left nicely breaks the symmetry.  I really don''t like what you did with dodging and burning here - the shot looks unnatural because of that. 6', '2007-01-10 15:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207511, 449195, 48890, '<td valign="top">-1 for romantic inclusion of the guitar + the tracks. -1 for poseur posture of the model. -1 for over-processing. 4</td>', '-1 for romantic inclusion of the guitar + the tracks. -1 for poseur posture of the model. -1 for over-processing. 4', '2007-01-10 15:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207527, 448735, 48890, '<td valign="top">The staging is not believable. 4</td>', 'The staging is not believable. 4', '2007-01-10 15:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207538, 449178, 48890, '<td valign="top">overprocessed. the composition is too tight.</td>', 'overprocessed. the composition is too tight.', '2007-01-10 15:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207556, 449289, 48890, '<td valign="top">The top of the shot is pretty.  In the bottom, I can see a man leaving the church, and a woman with kids doing the same.  I would not call this a decisive moment. :) 4</td>', 'The top of the shot is pretty.  In the bottom, I can see a man leaving the church, and a woman with kids doing the same.  I would not call this a decisive moment. :) 4', '2007-01-10 16:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207568, 447927, 48890, '<td valign="top">A funny subject.  I wish you didn''t frame the goat so tightly: including the entire bench and some of the environment would make this shot a lot better. 4</td>', 'A funny subject.  I wish you didn''t frame the goat so tightly: including the entire bench and some of the environment would make this shot a lot better. 4', '2007-01-10 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207871, 448820, 10985, '<td valign="top">Great idea, fun picture and angle.</td>', 'Great idea, fun picture and angle.', '2007-01-10 16:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207877, 448694, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, although the link with procrastination is difficult to see.</td>', 'Very nice image, although the link with procrastination is difficult to see.', '2007-01-10 16:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207882, 447004, 10985, '<td valign="top">OK, admit you painted them!  :o)<br/> <br/>Fun shot.</td>', 'OK, admit you painted them!  :o) Fun shot.', '2007-01-10 16:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3207886, 447045, 10985, '<td valign="top">Indeed. :o)</td>', 'Indeed. :o)', '2007-01-10 16:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
