(3211862, 449136, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is something I procrastinated over last year, too.  A 4-8 mile country ramble every weekend, but no proper hike.  I <b>shall</b> rectify that this year.<br/> <br/>Photographicly, a bit more detail to show the texture of the snow would be good, but very hard to expose correctly for.  That said, you certainly have displayed the isolation and hostility of the environment.</td>', 'This is something I procrastinated over last year, too.  A 4-8 mile country ramble every weekend, but no proper hike.  I shall rectify that this year. Photographicly, a bit more detail to show the texture of the snow would be good, but very hard to expose correctly for.  That said, you certainly have displayed the isolation and hostility of the environment.', '2007-01-11 11:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
