(3221088, 447835, 71971, '<td valign="top">This is the epitomy of procrastination. I love the chaotic mess, very detailed and lots to look at in this photo. Looks dingy, metallic, very good exposure for the contents of whats in the picture. I say this is a winner.</td>', 'This is the epitomy of procrastination. I love the chaotic mess, very detailed and lots to look at in this photo. Looks dingy, metallic, very good exposure for the contents of whats in the picture. I say this is a winner.', '2007-01-12 17:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
