(3221113, 449212, 50641, '<td valign="top">Who needs Elite Bird Ninjas when you have such a powerful shoehorn?  I liked this, thanks for the laugh ;-)</td>', 'Who needs Elite Bird Ninjas when you have such a powerful shoehorn?  I liked this, thanks for the laugh ;-)', '2007-01-12 17:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
