(3221660, 445993, 37390, '<td valign="top">Great picture. I would love to see a little more detail in the blacks.</td>', 'Great picture. I would love to see a little more detail in the blacks.', '2007-01-12 18:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222130, 447480, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, really like the difference of the dark foreground to the light snow on the mountains. Awesome work.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, really like the difference of the dark foreground to the light snow on the mountains. Awesome work.', '2007-01-12 19:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222143, 447979, 66348, '<td valign="top">Love how the foreground and sky sort of merge together. Sky is just incredible nice shot.</td>', 'Love how the foreground and sky sort of merge together. Sky is just incredible nice shot.', '2007-01-12 20:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222151, 447497, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of the mountains, sharpness seems to be off just a bit, or maybe my glasses just need cleaned, but whatever the case beautiful colors and capture. 7</td>', 'Beautiful shot of the mountains, sharpness seems to be off just a bit, or maybe my glasses just need cleaned, but whatever the case beautiful colors and capture. 7', '2007-01-12 20:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222173, 447450, 66348, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot. Wow colors and clarity and Post processing are incredible. I really hope this ribbons. It is by far the best of the challenge. Nice work.</td>', 'Incredible shot. Wow colors and clarity and Post processing are incredible. I really hope this ribbons. It is by far the best of the challenge. Nice work.', '2007-01-12 20:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222192, 447976, 66348, '<td valign="top">Wow great shot, I was born in San Diego so I can appreciate waves like this, because we only got them when big storms came in. This is like a 20 foot wave right? Incredible shot colors are incredible. Well done. 10....</td>', 'Wow great shot, I was born in San Diego so I can appreciate waves like this, because we only got them when big storms came in. This is like a 20 foot wave right? Incredible shot colors are incredible. Well done. 10....', '2007-01-12 20:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222228, 449344, 66348, '<td valign="top">Ok, I will give you benefit of the doubt here, because it is a good centered shot, clarity and sharpness are there. But for those of us that have lost some to suicide its really a hurtful and painful shot. To think that Suicide was put off last year is quite disturbing. It IS a powerful image I will give you that, but at the same time I guess I don''t understand how it was brought into the procrastination challenge. I surely hope there is nothing TOO deep about this shot to you, as in its something you''ve contemplated. Maybe I looked to deep into this shot, but like I said I recently lost someone to suicide so you can see where I am coming from. Good luck in the challenge. 7.</td>', 'Ok, I will give you benefit of the doubt here, because it is a good centered shot, clarity and sharpness are there. But for those of us that have lost some to suicide its really a hurtful and painful shot. To think that Suicide was put off last year is quite disturbing. It IS a powerful image I will give you that, but at the same time I guess I don''t understand how it was brought into the procrastination challenge. I surely hope there is nothing TOO deep about this shot to you, as in its something you''ve contemplated. Maybe I looked to deep into this shot, but like I said I recently lost someone to suicide so you can see where I am coming from. Good luck in the challenge. 7.', '2007-01-12 20:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222274, 447355, 173, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but not familar with the term and how it applies to procrastination.</td>', 'Great photo, but not familar with the term and how it applies to procrastination.', '2007-01-12 20:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222407, 448880, 173, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I think it would have looked better in B&amp;W. Good job though.</td>', 'I like the shot, but I think it would have looked better in B&W. Good job though.', '2007-01-12 20:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3222479, 448133, 173, '<td valign="top">Not clear on how this applies to the Challenge. The photo looks a little too much like a snap shot. I think if you were to twist the angle some, change to B&amp;W, and/or got closer it would have been a better shot.</td>', 'Not clear on how this applies to the Challenge. The photo looks a little too much like a snap shot. I think if you were to twist the angle some, change to B&W, and/or got closer it would have been a better shot.', '2007-01-12 20:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
