(3223457, 449101, 69407, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject - not one you normally think of regarding procrastination, but it happens so much! I love the way the girl works, but the right side really bothers me... I''m not sure cropping it would have helped, either, because her face is positioned perfectly where it is.</td>', 'This is a great subject - not one you normally think of regarding procrastination, but it happens so much! I love the way the girl works, but the right side really bothers me... I''m not sure cropping it would have helped, either, because her face is positioned perfectly where it is.', '2007-01-12 23:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223459, 447780, 69407, '<td valign="top">Great detail in this shot! Perfect subject... seeing it just makes me more relunctant to do anything at all....</td>', 'Great detail in this shot! Perfect subject... seeing it just makes me more relunctant to do anything at all....', '2007-01-12 23:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223467, 449151, 69407, '<td valign="top">Well done! That is a perfect pose - she looks like a warrior of cleanthliness! Not quite enough contrast around her hips and legs, she blends into the background just a little bit. Then again, it does help emphasize her face and ''weapons''.</td>', 'Well done! That is a perfect pose - she looks like a warrior of cleanthliness! Not quite enough contrast around her hips and legs, she blends into the background just a little bit. Then again, it does help emphasize her face and ''weapons''.', '2007-01-12 23:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3223476, 446694, 69407, '<td valign="top">There''s a certain lack of vibrancy (color, saturation?) to this photograph that really emphasizes the mood. The scene looks so cold and uninviting! I wouldn''t want to go out there, either.</td>', 'There''s a certain lack of vibrancy (color, saturation?) to this photograph that really emphasizes the mood. The scene looks so cold and uninviting! I wouldn''t want to go out there, either.', '2007-01-12 23:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
