(3223667, 448422, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is just a great shot. Love the composition. And isn''t he all of our heros. Only thing that kind of caught my attention was a slight glare on the bottom right corner, didn''t know if it was flash or fill lighting. Still a great setup and idea. Nice work.</td>', 'This is just a great shot. Love the composition. And isn''t he all of our heros. Only thing that kind of caught my attention was a slight glare on the bottom right corner, didn''t know if it was flash or fill lighting. Still a great setup and idea. Nice work.', '2007-01-13 00:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
