(3230260, 446350, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is a sort of odd picture, there''s a lot going on, but there''s not one thing that is the focal point in it.  It''s hard to know what to look at here.  One little detail, since this is advanced, you could have cloned out the "RR22".  I think it would be worth it to try a different angle, so that the clippers aren''t so right in the front.  Not sure though ....</td>', 'This is a sort of odd picture, there''s a lot going on, but there''s not one thing that is the focal point in it.  It''s hard to know what to look at here.  One little detail, since this is advanced, you could have cloned out the "RR22".  I think it would be worth it to try a different angle, so that the clippers aren''t so right in the front.  Not sure though ....', '2007-01-14 14:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
