(3232964, 449178, 69008, '<td valign="top">Great pic of a 30''s Ford. My grandfather had a 32 that he called "Leapin'' Lena" that he bought new. I still remember when he gave it to my brother. We found out right away that it would do 85 mph by the speedometer. <br/>Good job with the image. The moss growing on it is good for color in the image, and for the metal. The metal will not rust much where the moss is on it. <br/>Congrats on the ribbon, and thank you for jogging my memory.</td>', 'Great pic of a 30''s Ford. My grandfather had a 32 that he called "Leapin'' Lena" that he bought new. I still remember when he gave it to my brother. We found out right away that it would do 85 mph by the speedometer. Good job with the image. The moss growing on it is good for color in the image, and for the metal. The metal will not rust much where the moss is on it. Congrats on the ribbon, and thank you for jogging my memory.', '2007-01-15 01:07:43.000000', NULL, 0),
