(3233960, 448851, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Oliver :)<br/> <br/>"What did this match do right after the shot?" Well nothing I guess. It''s already put out, so it went into the trash. But what was it used for before it was put out? Just thought a put out looking cig. would''ve been more in touch with the title as I also dont associate matches with smoking either. I dont smoke but everyone around me who does, doesn''t use matches. But I hear using matches to light cigars is best. In general as an overall shot I would pick the match over a cig.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-15 09:32:18.</i></td>', 'Congratulations Oliver :) "What did this match do right after the shot?" Well nothing I guess. It''s already put out, so it went into the trash. But what was it used for before it was put out? Just thought a put out looking cig. would''ve been more in touch with the title as I also dont associate matches with smoking either. I dont smoke but everyone around me who does, doesn''t use matches. But I hear using matches to light cigars is best. In general as an overall shot I would pick the match over a cig.', '2007-01-15 09:31:31.000000', '2007-01-15 09:32:18.000000', 0),
(3233975, 447004, 67697, '<td valign="top">Nice one Teresa!  I could not vote in this but I did look thru the pics.  I saw this and just started laughing - how many times has this happened in our house! hehe <br/> <br/>Good job!</td>', 'Nice one Teresa!  I could not vote in this but I did look thru the pics.  I saw this and just started laughing - how many times has this happened in our house! hehe  Good job!', '2007-01-15 09:36:55.000000', NULL, 0),
