(3235178, 447835, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love this one. Be nice to see some processing details; I''m assuming tone mapping, or a heavy dose of shadow/highlight? Anyway, it''s always good to see a highly-detailed, "no subject" image do well; they''re one of my favorite sorts of image.</td>', 'I love this one. Be nice to see some processing details; I''m assuming tone mapping, or a heavy dose of shadow/highlight? Anyway, it''s always good to see a highly-detailed, "no subject" image do well; they''re one of my favorite sorts of image.', '2007-01-15 14:17:41.000000', NULL, 0),
