(3237579, 447126, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aimeethetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Holy moly you sure racked up the comments on this one eh?  53 during voting!!!!!  I don''t think I received that many comments during voting on any shot - even a ribbon image.  I say that alone is a success! :)  Sorry about the 4.1 - those dinks!  At least you met the challenge!  Thank you for entering it...still makes me laugh! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s what I do... enjoy!!! In my world, I post for fun. I make a few comments now and then... but in general... I say nothing. I am not into making a cute/great photo... I am all about having a laugh and enjoying life for what-ever reason. Is 53 comments during voting good???? I have no clue, so I''ll take your word for it. 4.1??? Bad????? Awwww...hell.... they are the ones who missed the fun. Thanks!!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by aimeethetoo: Holy moly you sure racked up the comments on this one eh?  53 during voting!!!!!  I don''t think I received that many comments during voting on any shot - even a ribbon image.  I say that alone is a success! :)  Sorry about the 4.1 - those dinks!  At least you met the challenge!  Thank you for entering it...still makes me laugh!   That''s what I do... enjoy!!! In my world, I post for fun. I make a few comments now and then... but in general... I say nothing. I am not into making a cute/great photo... I am all about having a laugh and enjoying life for what-ever reason. Is 53 comments during voting good???? I have no clue, so I''ll take your word for it. 4.1??? Bad????? Awwww...hell.... they are the ones who missed the fun. Thanks!!!!', '2007-01-15 23:14:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3237616, 447126, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I love how you''re description plays along... but my very favorite thing about this are the "too dark" comments. Can I bump my score after a challenge? I want to give you a 10. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well! I''ll take the 10! But not because it means something to me...but because you understand and get the whole point of the post. My score is nothing...I really don''t care how people rate my work. Honest... I don''t care. But when a few (like you) get the fun.... well then, that makes it all worth while. Yeah, "Too dark", "DNMC" "What are you doing?"...love those quotes.... imbeciles.....<br/>I had one comment, "DNMC IMO" I know it is, "Did Not Meet Challenge In My Opinion." but I H-A-T-E that kind''a comment. So I personalized a reply, "YIDYJDNLDEOWACB" (Yes It Did You Just Did Not Look Deep Enough Or With A Clever Brain." or something... I made up very much like that. Thanks. And if ya want to see more of my stuff and have a place to post where there is a lot more fun<br/>www.usefilm.com I am under Jim Loy there. Come on over and have a ball!!!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: I love how you''re description plays along... but my very favorite thing about this are the "too dark" comments. Can I bump my score after a challenge? I want to give you a 10.   Well! I''ll take the 10! But not because it means something to me...but because you understand and get the whole point of the post. My score is nothing...I really don''t care how people rate my work. Honest... I don''t care. But when a few (like you) get the fun.... well then, that makes it all worth while. Yeah, "Too dark", "DNMC" "What are you doing?"...love those quotes.... imbeciles.....I had one comment, "DNMC IMO" I know it is, "Did Not Meet Challenge In My Opinion." but I H-A-T-E that kind''a comment. So I personalized a reply, "YIDYJDNLDEOWACB" (Yes It Did You Just Did Not Look Deep Enough Or With A Clever Brain." or something... I made up very much like that. Thanks. And if ya want to see more of my stuff and have a place to post where there is a lot more funwww.usefilm.com I am under Jim Loy there. Come on over and have a ball!!!!!', '2007-01-15 23:24:55.000000', NULL, 0),
