(3249787, 448590, 63398, '<td valign="top">Technically correct, a good all ''round shot, BUT......you know as well as I that you wrote all that up and put it up neatly. OCD and procrastination go hand in hand, so when you gather up all the notes or finally write them, it''s too orderly to carry the message properly. Of course, I may have interpreted this entirely wrong.8&gt;)</td>', 'Technically correct, a good all ''round shot, BUT......you know as well as I that you wrote all that up and put it up neatly. OCD and procrastination go hand in hand, so when you gather up all the notes or finally write them, it''s too orderly to carry the message properly. Of course, I may have interpreted this entirely wrong.8>)', '2007-01-18 00:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
