(3250972, 447780, 63398, '<td valign="top">Basically a good pic.....I''m surprised with the lighting to see so much pixelation. Was this intentional? A tad title driven, but a respectable entry.</td>', 'Basically a good pic.....I''m surprised with the lighting to see so much pixelation. Was this intentional? A tad title driven, but a respectable entry.', '2007-01-18 09:53:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3250983, 448984, 63398, '<td valign="top">Ya know what? I can''t find anything other than this photograph is just too smooth and subtle to have been picked up on properly in a challenge.....you won''t get people to take the time to really look at it. They want the Icelandic shock photos. If I was visiting, and this was in the hallway between the kitchen and the main room, I would have gotten stuck there admiring it. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Ya know what? I can''t find anything other than this photograph is just too smooth and subtle to have been picked up on properly in a challenge.....you won''t get people to take the time to really look at it. They want the Icelandic shock photos. If I was visiting, and this was in the hallway between the kitchen and the main room, I would have gotten stuck there admiring it. Very nice shot.', '2007-01-18 09:57:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3251087, 447004, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of perfectly meeting the challenge - no question.   I like the story too.   The monochromatic subject is awesome and i wish I thought of something that good.  I agree that a slightly different crop might have helped as well as possibly removing some of the extraneous color in the shadow area.  I didn''t vote but I would have gone 7 or 8 for sure.</td>', 'This is a great example of perfectly meeting the challenge - no question.   I like the story too.   The monochromatic subject is awesome and i wish I thought of something that good.  I agree that a slightly different crop might have helped as well as possibly removing some of the extraneous color in the shadow area.  I didn''t vote but I would have gone 7 or 8 for sure.', '2007-01-18 10:35:55.000000', NULL, 0),
